        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "하나지방에서는 매우\n희귀한 나무열매.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Une Baie très rare à Unys.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Eine Beerensorte, die in der Einall-Region\nganz besonders selten ist.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Una baya muy rara en la región de Teselia.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Bacca molto rara a Unima.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A Berry to be used in cooking.\nThis Berry is very rare and hard\nto obtain in the Unova region.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "イッシュ地方では　とても\n珍しい　きのみ。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Una baya muy rara en la región de Teselia.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "かわいさに　みがきを　かける　ための\nポロックを　つくるとき　つかわれる。\nももいろの　みは　たべると　あまい。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "귀여움을 연마하기 위한\n포켓몬스넥을 만들 때 사용된다.\n담홍색 열매는 먹으면 달다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "製作用於增進可愛的\n寶可方塊時使用。\n粉紅色的果實嘗起來是甜的。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Une Baie rose au goût sucré, utilisée pour préparer\ndes Pokéblocs permettant d’augmenter la Grâce\nd’un Pokémon.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Eine Beerensorte, die als Zutat für Pokériegel\nverwendet wird, welche die Putzigkeit erhöhen.\nIhr rosa Fruchtfleisch schmeckt süßlich.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Se utiliza en la producción de Pokécubos que\npotencian la dulzura. Es de color rosa y sabor\ndulce.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Bacca rosa dal sapore dolce usata per creare\nPokémelle che aumentano la Grazia del Pokémon.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Used to make Pokéblocks that will enhance your\nCuteness. Its pink flesh is sweet when eaten.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "かわいさに　磨きを　かける　ための\nポロックを　つくるとき　使われる。\n桃色の実は　食べると　甘い。",
